// Phase S02's exit captures: the valley from Tithe Hill at dawn, noon, dusk, and night,
// in rain, and in fog; and the shimmer check across the barley from the road, a slow
// sideways move of a small part of a pixel a frame, in clear air, at dusk, in rain, and
// in fog; and across the pasture seen almost edge on, alone, in front of the east wood,
// and at dusk. Every shot is also a glyph-off comparison.
